WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:04.980
Come in and have a look at this top secret
project we've been working on.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:10.860
It's finally time to push the button and put
the MIGHTY SHRINK LAZORRR to the test!

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.340
I’m ready.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:17.060
We did it!

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:19.539
It worked.

00:00:19.539 --> 00:00:23.310
Right under our noses there is so much hidden
that we never get to see with our own eyes

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:29.340
– entire realms of bizarre structures and
outlandish creatures.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.960
What a magical place this is.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:37.620
A forest of slime molds, single-celled organisms
that work together and form fungus-like structures.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:41.010
But we don't have time to hang out with these
calm fellows any longer.

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:42.109
Psssst!

00:00:42.109 --> 00:00:47.309
Now we’re in the kingdom of the mighty tardigrades
– don’t disturb them in their death-like

00:00:47.309 --> 00:00:48.309
slumber.

00:00:48.309 --> 00:00:52.239
Don’t worry though, they will wake up once
the conditions are less rough.

00:00:52.239 --> 00:00:55.739
Oof, didn’t mean to get in the way!

00:00:55.739 --> 00:01:00.680
Your cells are hustling to keep you alive,
coordinating myriads of proteins.

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.270
This might be the weirdest place yet, with
no up or down.

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:08.400
There’s way too much going on – better
move on.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:12.440
Now we are inside one of the parts that allow
you to watch this video.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:17.409
The structure of a microchip is so small,
it nearly breaks the rules of the quantum

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:18.460
realm.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:22.940
– Wait, something is happening!

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:29.060
These hidden worlds are all part of our 12,023
Human Era Calendar.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:33.100
This time you can join us on a journey through
the microcosm.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:37.720
With each turn of the page you will reveal
a new world you didn’t know existed right

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:39.619
beneath your feet.

00:01:39.619 --> 00:01:45.430
You know the drill by now: as always it’s
a super high-quality calendar, very shiny

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:47.950
and only available for a short time.

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:51.479
We also have a few special deals for you in
our shop.

00:01:51.479 --> 00:01:55.140
The calendar is a true piece of kurzgesagt
you can take home with you.

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:59.610
And we say this every year but it’s true:
every calendar purchase directly supports

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:01.240
what we do here at kurzgesagt.

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:07.070
And that’s not just creating videos but
sparking curiosity all around the world.

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:12.110
So because of you, we can spread knowledge
and ignite an appreciation for space, nature

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.310
and life in people everywhere.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:17.140
Thank you so much for making this possible!

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:20.480
Have a wonderful 12,023!

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:21.560
See you down in January!

